{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:972","content":{"id":972,"title":"视频笔记","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"界面说明"}],"disableDrag":false,"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在"},{"type":"formatted","text":"项目","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"中，我们支持添加一条视频笔记，支持的视频来源有"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地视频"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网络视频"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"bilibili 视频"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"youtube 视频"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"notion 视频"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"添加视频后，我们会进入到视频笔记特定的 UI"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d793c9b7-778d-49f3-938e-0292f253c646.webp","uuid":"d6b92333-45a4-402e-8f60-abbcbfb57b33","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d793c9b7-778d-49f3-938e-0292f253c646.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大致分为三个区域："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"左上角是视频，无论来源是什么，我们都会尝试把视频下载到本地"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"左下角是通过 AI 分析出来的视频亮点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"右侧有好几个 Tab，有不同的功能"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"转录，显示根据视频转录出来的字幕轴"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总结，基于转录结果进行的内容总结"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对话，可以直接和 AI 对话讨论视频内容"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"笔记，可以边看视频边做笔记，记录一些亮点和灵感"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"转录"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先我们要先声明一点，我们不是把视频直接输入给模型，我们经过好几步："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提取视频音频"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用音频转录程序将音频提取为字幕"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以上所有和 AI 相关的能力全部都要基于将视频转录为文字之后才能使用，否则 AI 根本不知道视频讲了什么，所以转录非常关键，这里有几个配置。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地转录的程序，首先我们需要在语音转录中下载程序和模型，这里下一个 Base 就够用了"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fa48549a-e1db-4ef4-ab78-123d86e79cbd.webp","uuid":"30fe31fc-7616-4816-bed3-3d360725d6a0","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fa48549a-e1db-4ef4-ab78-123d86e79cbd.webp","width":720}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模型支持两种转录"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"词级别的，每一个词都有一个时间戳"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"句子级别的，自动根据语音划分为句子"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"理论上我们选择句子级别的转录就好，但是我发现模型对句子的断句十分的差，它断不好，总是在错误的地方断开，因此这里建议使用词级别的语音转录，然后通过大模型来进行断句优化"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0ff5a583-ea65-4b3a-9114-654954c0085e.webp","uuid":"6fd20f21-d8d7-4f4b-8378-0b2aece076ce","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0ff5a583-ea65-4b3a-9114-654954c0085e.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要在大语言模型中选择进行断句优化的模型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3ae17ce6-8dc2-4f3f-9075-45ed12e92614.webp","uuid":"084d2d8b-e00a-4827-ab8b-173fff49f454","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3ae17ce6-8dc2-4f3f-9075-45ed12e92614.webp","width":720}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"笔记"}],"disableDrag":false,"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在笔记编辑区域的时候，为视频笔记提供了两个快捷键"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"kbd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"mod + shift + t"}]},{"text":" 插入时间戳，点击时间戳就可以跳转，鼠标放到时间戳上还能显示这一帧的图片","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_19a2c455-d177-4f9f-bc9f-51a208a55d51.webp","uuid":"08266b2d-99f4-4e13-a29d-f4e922bd1683","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_19a2c455-d177-4f9f-bc9f-51a208a55d51.webp","width":282.0163429111337}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"kbd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"mod + shift + s"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对当前播放时刻的帧截取并插入到笔记中，点击该图片也会自动进行跳转"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_24ed2530-707c-45ab-b235-128a4c74b43b.webp","uuid":"2b88684f-eca4-4f51-a95f-b04a07cc6734","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_24ed2530-707c-45ab-b235-128a4c74b43b.webp","width":373.569474522864}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视频转写"}],"disableDrag":false,"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们大部分对 AI 的用法是让 AI 进行总结，把内容变短，但是这样往往会失去精华，我们应该让 AI 帮我们把内容进行变长，让 AI 基于视频内容进行扩展，基于这个思路，我们可以让 AI 对视频内容进行转写，输出一份更长的电子书。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在右上角有一个按钮，就是让 AI 对视频内容进行转写"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1e5965e8-b8f5-4878-af21-6c01934bb14b.webp","uuid":"63f71875-5db0-4be8-97bf-cdc5f9874cd2","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1e5965e8-b8f5-4878-af21-6c01934bb14b.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持四种转写风格，选择之后就可以让 AI 生成草稿，生成草稿的模型也需要在大语言模型设置中进行配置"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_893e85e0-d44d-45da-83f8-c6dcc0b1206f.webp","uuid":"0743da9c-d43d-4295-b738-a96e214065c0","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_893e85e0-d44d-45da-83f8-c6dcc0b1206f.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"生成草稿完成之后我们可以进行审阅并起进行修改，没有问题后我们可以进行下一步，把生成的内容导出为电子书"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ed20a78c-bb61-425f-a293-7da6e0538328.webp","uuid":"a70a1083-5207-4f1b-a1e1-b39cfeb3a257","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ed20a78c-bb61-425f-a293-7da6e0538328.webp","width":720}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},{"label":"视频笔记","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:972","type":"doc","id":972}}],"prevPage":{"title":"微信公众号","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:971","type":"doc","id":971}},"nextPage":{"title":"Vibe Learning","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:973","type":"doc","id":973}},"createTime":1777708980430,"updateTime":1777721253174,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777721253174}}